" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Leave Your Mark</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a voice. Use it. Make choices that will persist throughout the game. What you do here matters. Even if it all ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105190/extras/540818e932fbd184b9f5433808ebd6ef.poster.avif?t=1780926320\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105190/extras/540818e932fbd184b9f5433808ebd6ef.webm?t=1780926320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105190/extras/540818e932fbd184b9f5433808ebd6ef.mp4?t=1780926320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Coming of Age</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends, kicking around on a piece of ground in your home town. Inspired by the era of fuck-off attitude and Waffle House cigarettes. Give a shit about something, nothing, and everything all at once. Learn to live in a society caving in on itself. Make some stupid choices. We've all been there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105190/extras/ac4d61ae7c764e8108b266c3c62ef0ad.poster.avif?t=1780926320\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105190/extras/ac4d61ae7c764e8108b266c3c62ef0ad.webm?t=1780926320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105190/extras/ac4d61ae7c764e8108b266c3c62ef0ad.mp4?t=1780926320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suburban exploration (aka trespassing) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home parties </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teen angst</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rat funerals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skating </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loitering with friends </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listening to mixtapes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wasting your youth (again) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vandalism </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theft </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mundanity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105190/extras/82b7a6d8ff1bc26c6b081fcde8ec8826.poster.avif?t=1780926320\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105190/extras/82b7a6d8ff1bc26c6b081fcde8ec8826.webm?t=1780926320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105190/extras/82b7a6d8ff1bc26c6b081fcde8ec8826.mp4?t=1780926320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>❀ Can hope blossom under an Orange Sky? ❀</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105190/extras/779262ab885191b84a2533e51b73f3c9.avif?t=1780926320\" width=1541 height=1659 /></span></p>", "about_the_gam